! kayardild.xfst
! Loads the lexicon, composes it with the sandhi rule, then applies
! every test input (read from kayardild_inputs.txt) and writes the
! results to kayardild_output.txt.

clear stack;
read lexc < kayardild.txt
define Lexicon
source sandhi.txt
regex Lexicon .o. ClusterSimplification;

apply down < kayardild_inputs.txt > kayardild_output.txt
